 10:17\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(18,10,17)\">Job 10:17</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> revival after death, under figure of <highlight>relief</highlight> from military service <ref ref=\"Job 14:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,14,14)\">Job 14:14</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>changing, varying</highlight>, of course of life <bdbheb>אֲשֶׁר אֵין חֲלִיפוֺת לָ֑מוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 55:20\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"55\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"55\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(19,55,20)\">Ps 55:20</ref> of the wicked, <highlight>with whom are no changings</highlight>, i.e. they do evil incessantly, steadily (|| <bdbheb>ולא יָרְאוּ אלהים</bdbheb>) so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kmp')\">Kmp</lookup> Hu <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sch')\">Sch</lookup> and others; but the expression is peculiar and obscure; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Calv')\">Calv</lookup> <highlight>vicissitudes</highlight>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('He')\">Hengst</lookup> <highlight>discharges</highlight>; text perhaps corrupt. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Job 14:14", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 14, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Judg 14:19", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 14, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Judg 14:13", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 14, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "2Kgs 5:5", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 5, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Gen 45:22", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 45, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Judg 14:12", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 14, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "2Kgs 5:22", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 5, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "2Kgs 5:23", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 5, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "1Kgs 5:28", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 5, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Job 10:17", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 10, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Ps 55:20", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 55, "verse": 20}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["חֲלִיפָה", "